\trowd\trgaph90\trleft0\clcbpat7\cellx2500\clcbpat7\cellx7300\clcbpat7\cellx10200
\pard\intbl{\cf2 One-shot}\cell\pard\intbl{the LFO runs only one cycle and then stops (melodies, effect entries).}\cell\pard\intbl{\cf4 yes (LFO1..LFO8 One-shot)}\cell\row
\trowd\trgaph90\trleft0\clcbpat8\cellx2500\clcbpat8\cellx7300\clcbpat8\cellx10200
\pard\intbl{\cf2 Retrigger}\cell\pard\intbl{free, note on, note off, on + off, end of partner LFO (one-shot), sidechain trigger, SC pitch > threshold, threshold gate opens, silence, output > threshold.}\cell\pard\intbl{\cf4 yes (LFO1..LFO8 Trigger)}\cell\row
\trowd\trgaph90\trleft0\clcbpat7\cellx2500\clcbpat7\cellx7300\clcbpat7\cellx10200
\pard\intbl{\cf2 Partner}\cell\pard\intbl{which LFO triggers the event "End of partner LFO (one-shot)" with its one-shot end - for start and stop. Default: 1 and 2 or 3 and 4 mutually; any chains possible (e.g. 1 -> 2 -> 3 -> 4). The partner must be set to "One-shot". Only active if start or stop uses this event.}\cell\pard\intbl{\cf4 yes (LFO1..LFO8 Partner)}\cell\row
\trowd\trgaph90\trleft0\clcbpat8\cellx2500\clcbpat8\cellx7300\clcbpat8\cellx10200
\pard\intbl{\cf2 Stop}\cell\pard\intbl{Off trigger: the event (Note on, Note off, End partner LFO, Sidechain trigger, SC pitch, Threshold gate, Silence, Output > Threshold) halts the LFO - no modulation until its start event starts it again. "never" = keeps running. Only works with a start event (not with "free"); with Stop the LFO also waits for its first start initially. For per-note LFOs, "Note off" halts only the released note. Delay as for the start (Timing / Events tab). "after time": the LFO halts after a fixed run time from its start - in ms or as a note value (2/1, 1/1, 1/2, 1/4, 1/4T ...; a note value takes precedence over ms).}\cell\pard\intbl{\cf4 yes (LFO1..LFO8 Stop, Stop time, Stop time sync)}\cell\row
\trowd\trgaph90\trleft0\clcbpat7\cellx2500\clcbpat7\cellx7300\clcbpat7\cellx10200
\pard\intbl{\cf2 Output > Threshold}\cell\pard\intbl{Trigger on the own output level: when it exceeds the threshold, an LFO with this retrigger mode starts. An LFO started this way does not retrigger itself while it is running (no feedback).}\cell\pard\intbl{\cf4 yes (Output threshold)}\cell\row
\trowd\trgaph90\trleft0\clcbpat8\cellx2500\clcbpat8\cellx7300\clcbpat8\cellx10200
\pard\intbl{\cf2 Sidechain trigger: Level / Pitch}\cell\pard\intbl{when the trigger fires: level above the threshold and/or pitch above the note; both checked = both required.}\cell\pard\intbl{\cf4 yes (not modulatable; SC trig level, SC Threshold, SC trig pitch, SC pitch threshold)}\cell\row
\trowd\trgaph90\trleft0\clcbpat7\cellx2500\clcbpat7\cellx7300\clcbpat7\cellx10200
\pard\intbl{\cf2 Auto-Pitch}\cell\pard\intbl{pitch comes from the sidechain (sung note) instead of the key - continuous or in semitones.}\cell\pard\intbl{\cf4 yes (Auto-Pitch)}\cell\row
